{"id":"n67843-9-9","stage":2,"title":"옮기다 · 传染","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n67843-9-9-1","ko":"너 눈병 걸렸는데 수영장에 왔어? 사람들한테 눈병 옮기면 어떻게 해.","zh":"你得了眼病还来游泳池？要是传染给别人怎么办？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"너","meaning":"你","explanation":"너：你。","readings":[{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64390","senseId":"1","lemma":"너","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}},{"text":"눈병","meaning":"眼疾","explanation":"눈병：眼疾。","readings":[{"term":"눈병","audio":"/audio/4c674192f6ffda6b2b60.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"23398","senseId":"1","lemma":"눈병","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"눈병","audio":"/audio/4c674192f6ffda6b2b60.mp3"}},{"text":"걸렸는데","meaning":"患","explanation":"걸리다：患；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；는데：先交代背景，再引出后文的转折、补充、请求或问题。","readings":[{"term":"걸리다","audio":"/audio/d94590a358564fb83462.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"86940","senseId":"8","lemma":"걸리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"걸렸는데","audio":"/audio/f39877fbdd34dc9a7f9e.mp3"}},{"text":"수영장에","meaning":"游泳场，游泳池","explanation":"수영장：游泳场，游泳池；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"수영장","audio":"/audio/b458b878d51b2c8d51db.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26858","senseId":"1","lemma":"수영장","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"수영장에","audio":"/audio/f3d87134bc791bc73353.mp3"}},{"text":"왔어?","meaning":"到，来到","explanation":"오다：到，来到；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"오다","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69514","senseId":"10","lemma":"오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"왔어","audio":"/audio/1c7a0c0d37b0eadd46f3.mp3"}},{"text":"사람들한테","meaning":"人们，大家","explanation":"사람：人们，大家；들：复数后缀，表示多个对象；한테：口语格助词，表示动作所涉及的人：“给、对、向”等。","readings":[{"term":"사람","audio":"/audio/389e7564ae2551b4f94d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58161","senseId":"8","lemma":"사람","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"사람들한테","audio":"/audio/927461b1eb3aba4bd41d.mp3"}},{"text":"눈병","meaning":"眼疾","explanation":"눈병：眼疾。","readings":[{"term":"눈병","audio":"/audio/4c674192f6ffda6b2b60.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"23398","senseId":"1","lemma":"눈병","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"눈병","audio":"/audio/4c674192f6ffda6b2b60.mp3"}},{"text":"옮기면","meaning":"传染","explanation":"옮기다：传染；면：表示条件或假设：“如果、若、……的话”。","readings":[{"term":"옮기다","audio":"/audio/51842eae1c09c04b9499.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67843","senseId":"9","lemma":"옮기다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"옮기면","audio":"/audio/995583fb319e70863b06.mp3"}},{"text":"어떻게","meaning":"怎么样","explanation":"어떻다：怎么样；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"어떻다","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70482","senseId":"1","lemma":"어떻다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어떻게","audio":"/audio/64e493d09f1b306ade0c.mp3"}},{"text":"해.","meaning":"办、做（어떻게 해：怎么办）","explanation":"어떻게 해 在这里担忧如果眼病传染给别人该怎么办，不是 하다 表示如何对待别人或产生影响的义项。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"해","audio":"/audio/b4ec4274b7799f1f17e5.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"734dae8e9d9a8f8b","term":"너","zh":"你","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3","entryId":"64390","definition":"指代听者，用于朋友或晚辈。","pronunciation":["너"]},{"id":"4c674192f6ffda6b","term":"눈병","zh":"眼疾","audio":"/audio/4c674192f6ffda6b2b60.mp3","entryId":"23398","definition":"眼睛部位生的病。","pronunciation":["눈뼝"]},{"id":"d94590a358564fb8","term":"걸리다","zh":"患","audio":"/audio/d94590a358564fb83462.mp3","entryId":"86940","definition":"得病。","pronunciation":["걸리다"]},{"id":"b458b878d51b